---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Accessibility" description="Monadic Labs accessibility statement.">
  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-blue-400">~/accessibility$</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold">Accessibility</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 rounded-md border border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 p-4 text-sm text-amber-500">
      Placeholder statement — run this site through an actual accessibility audit
      (contrast, keyboard nav, screen reader pass) before relying on this claim.
    </p>
    <div class="markdown mt-8">
      <p>We aim for this site to be usable by as many people as possible,
      including via keyboard navigation and screen readers.</p>
      <h2>Known limitations</h2>
      <p>This site is under active development. If you hit an accessibility
      barrier, please let us know and we'll fix it.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Report an issue: <a href="mailto:hello@monadiclabs.com">hello@monadiclabs.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
